The runtime uses Hyphae and hyphae-embed from
https://github.com/Hyphae-Research-Foundation/hyphae
Copyright 2026 Celiums Solutions LLC.
Hyphae software and normative specifications are Apache-2.0. Its narrative
documentation uses CC-BY-SA-4.0. Exact source revisions and component notices
are retained with the runtime bundle and source lock.

hyphae-embed uses Hyphae's existing Candle-based embedding implementation.
The optional BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5 reference model is MIT-licensed; its source,
revision and file digests are recorded in models.lock.json.

Omarchy is an independently licensed MIT project:
https://github.com/omacom/omarchy
The plugin imports the user's installed Omarchy/Quickshell UI components.

Third-party components retain their licenses and trademarks. Runtime bundles
include Hyphae's THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md, a CycloneDX Cargo dependency inventory,
and dependency license texts, including the Candle components. The inventory
includes normal and build dependencies for the target; system libraries and
the Rust toolchain are separate. Test-only host dependencies are pinned
by tests/hosts/package-lock.json and are not distributed in the plugin archive.
